  "notes": "USAGE:\nA valued trait in leadership and business contexts. Refers to the ability to make firm decisions without excessive hesitation.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {決断力|けつだんりょく}がある - to be decisive\n- {決断力|けつだんりょく}に{欠|か}ける - to lack decisiveness\n- {決断力|けつだんりょく}を{発揮|はっき}する - to demonstrate decisiveness\n\nRELATED ABILITIES:\n- {判断力|はんだんりょく} - judgment\n- {行動力|こうどうりょく} - ability to take action\n- {実行力|じっこうりょく} - ability to execute",
